      "question": "The Assam government observed the birthday of ________ on 31 March 2023, as Students Day in the state. &#2309;&#2360;&#2350; &#2360;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; 31 &#2350;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2330; 2023 &#2325;&#2379; ________ &#2325;&#2375; &#2332;&#2344;&#2381;&#2350;&#2342;&#2367;&#2344; &#2325;&#2379; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2331;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352; &#2342;&#2367;&#2357;&#2360; &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2350;&#2344;&#2366;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The Assam government observed the birthday of ________ on 31 March 2023, as Students Day in the state.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2309;&#2360;&#2350; &#2360;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; 31 &#2350;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2330; 2023 &#2325;&#2379; ________ &#2325;&#2375; &#2332;&#2344;&#2381;&#2350;&#2342;&#2367;&#2344; &#2325;&#2379; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2331;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352; &#2342;&#2367;&#2357;&#2360; &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2350;&#2344;&#2366;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Bodofa Upendra Nath Brahma &#2348;&#2379;&#2337;&#2379;&#2347;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2375;&#2344;&#2381;&#2342;&#2381;&#2352; &#2344;&#2366;&#2341; &#2348;&#2381;&#2352;&#2361;&#2381;&#2350;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Bodofa Upendra Nath Brahma</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2348;&#2379;&#2337;&#2379;&#2347;&#2366; &#2313;&#2346;&#2375;&#2344;&#2381;&#2342;&#2381;&#2352; &#2344;&#2366;&#2341; &#2348;&#2381;&#2352;&#2361;&#2381;&#2350;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
