          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Biraj Kumar Sarma</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2348;&#2367;&#2352;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2369;&#2350;&#2366;&#2352; &#2358;&#2352;&#2381;&#2350;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Prafulla Kumar Mahanta &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2347;&#2369;&#2354;&#2381;&#2354; &#2325;&#2369;&#2350;&#2366;&#2352; &#2350;&#2361;&#2306;&#2340;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Prafulla Kumar Mahanta</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2347;&#2369;&#2354;&#2381;&#2354; &#2325;&#2369;&#2350;&#2366;&#2352; &#2350;&#2361;&#2306;&#2340;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Bhrigu Kumar Phukan &#2349;&#2371;&#2327;&#2369; &#2325;&#2369;&#2350;&#2366;&#2352; &#2347;&#2369;&#2325;&#2344;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Bhrigu Kumar Phukan</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2349;&#2371;&#2327;&#2369; &#2325;&#2369;&#2350;&#2366;&#2352; &#2347;&#2369;&#2325;&#2344;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>&#183; The Assam government observed the birthday of <b>Bodofa Upendra Nath Brahma</b> on 31 March 2023, as Students Day in the state.</p><p>&#183; Upendra Nath Brahma was a prominent Bodo leader who advocated for the rights and recognition of the Bodo people in Assam. </p><p>&#183; He is often referred to as \"Bodofa\" (Father of the Bodos). </p><p>&#183; The Assam government's decision to observe his birthday as Students Day recognizes his significant contributions and leadership.</p>",
