      "question": "In which year did Narendra Modi propose to celebrate a day for yoga as 'International Day of Yoga' while speaking at the United Nations General Assembly? &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2369;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340; &#2352;&#2366;&#2359;&#2381;&#2335;&#2381;&#2352; &#2350;&#2361;&#2366;&#2360;&#2349;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2379;&#2354;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2369;&#2319; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2368;. &#2344;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2342;&#2381;&#2352; &#2350;&#2379;&#2342;&#2368; &#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2319;&#2325; &#2342;&#2367;&#2344; '&#2309;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2359;&#2381;&#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2368;&#2351; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2342;&#2367;&#2357;&#2360;' &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2350;&#2344;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2366;&#2357; &#2352;&#2326;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In which year did Narendra Modi propose to celebrate a day for yoga as 'International Day of Yoga' while speaking at the United Nations General Assembly?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2369;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340; &#2352;&#2366;&#2359;&#2381;&#2335;&#2381;&#2352; &#2350;&#2361;&#2366;&#2360;&#2349;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2379;&#2354;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2369;&#2319; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2368;. &#2344;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2342;&#2381;&#2352; &#2350;&#2379;&#2342;&#2368; &#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2319;&#2325; &#2342;&#2367;&#2344; '&#2309;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2359;&#2381;&#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2368;&#2351; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2342;&#2367;&#2357;&#2360;' &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2350;&#2344;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2366;&#2357; &#2352;&#2326;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "2013 2013",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">2013</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2013</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "2015 2015",
