      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Gurpurab is celebrated to commemorate the birthday of Guru Nanak Dev Ji. He was the _________ guru of Sikhs?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2327;&#2369;&#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2352;&#2381;&#2357; &#2327;&#2369;&#2352;&#2369; &#2344;&#2366;&#2344;&#2325; &#2342;&#2375;&#2357; &#2332;&#2368; &#2325;&#2375; &#2332;&#2344;&#2381;&#2350;&#2342;&#2367;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2313;&#2346;&#2354;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2381;&#2351; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2350;&#2344;&#2366;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2357;&#2361; &#2360;&#2367;&#2326;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; _________ &#2327;&#2369;&#2352;&#2369; &#2341;&#2375;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
